WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.180
- Hello aspiring teachers,

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.940
Sal here from the
not-for-profit Khan Academy.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.570
And all of us at Khan Academy and ETS

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.263
makers of the Praxis Core Exam recognize

00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:14.050
that teachers are the most essential part

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.700
of a learning experience

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.810
and that's why today
we're excited to announce

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.040
the launch of Official Praxis Core Prep

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:26.540
from Khan Academy and ETS to
truly level the playing field

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:31.000
and broaden the pipeline of
teachers throughout the country.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.640
Aspiring teachers are going to be able

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.490
to come to Khan Academy, get diagnostics,

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.250
and work on math, reading, and writing,

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.787
and understand what your gaps are

00:00:39.787 --> 00:00:41.973
and the software will adapt to allow you

00:00:41.973 --> 00:00:45.460
to work on what will be
highest leverage for you

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.700
to prepare for the Praxis Core and beyond.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.730
This is completely free,
it is not for profit

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.690
and we're confident that if
we give you this little help

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.230
that you'll be able to run with it

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:59.603
and impact generations
of students to come.

